.TH parsec-cli-certificate 1  "certificate " 
.SH NAME
parsec\-cli\-certificate \- Contains subcommands related to certificate
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBparsec\-cli certificate\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Contains subcommands related to certificate
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
parsec\-cli\-certificate\-poll(1)
Poll the server for new certificates
.TP
parsec\-cli\-certificate\-forget\-all\-certificates(1)
Forget all certificates from the local database, this is not needed under normal circumstances
.TP
parsec\-cli\-certificate\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
